ata-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灰尘；尘埃</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91541\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はほこりを<ruby>払<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她付出了灰尘。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">誇り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほこり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">骄傲；自豪；荣誉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"119513\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>父親<rp>(</rp><rt>ちちおや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>誇<rp>(</rp><rt>ほこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りに<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うのも<ruby>当然<rp>(</rp><rt>とうぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他很自豪,他对父亲感到骄傲。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">誇る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほこる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夸耀；以…自豪；为…感到骄傲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229564\">あんなに<ruby>長所<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのに<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>誇<rp>(</rp><rt>ほこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">虽然有这么多好处,但她并不自豪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">綻びる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほころびる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开线；绽线；（衣物）裂开；撕破；开始绽放；初绽；（花）开始开放；展颜欢笑；露出笑容；绽开笑容</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227541\">おまえのジーンズの<ruby>綻<rp>(</rp><rt>ほころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びを<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>繕<rp>(</rp><rt>つくろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってもらいなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让她把你的珍珠的碎片交给她。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">保護</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保护；保障；监护；照顾；赞助；保存；保留；维护</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210263\">その<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はおじの<ruby>保護<rp>(</rp><rt>ほご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个男孩被叔叔保护。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">星</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">星；恒星；行星；天体；星号；星形符号；米字号；明星；红星；点；斑点；小点；靶心；犯人；嫌疑人；作案人；命星；命运之星；运势；（相扑）星（胜负记号）；胜场；成绩；星位；星点；（烟花）亮珠；星体</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143038\"><ruby>星<rp>(</rp><rt>ほし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かりでかすんで<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">星星在城市的光明中可见。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">欲しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">想要；希望拥有；想让（某人）做；希望（某人）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79360\"><ruby>友人<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はマイカーを<ruby>欲<rp>(</rp><rt>ほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しがっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的朋友想要迈克尔。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">干し物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほしもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">晒干的东西（尤指衣物、染布等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">保守</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほしゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">维护；保养；维持；保守主义；保守性；守护</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100093\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>保守<rp>(</rp><rt>ほしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是保守派。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">保証</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保证；担保；保障；保修；质保</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85543\"><ruby>美術商<rp>(</rp><rt>びじゅつしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>本物<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だと<ruby>保証<rp>(</rp><rt>ほしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">艺术家保证这幅画是真实的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">保障</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保证；担保；保障；保修；质保</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85543\"><ruby>美術商<rp>(</rp><rt>びじゅつしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>絵<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>本物<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だと<ruby>保証<rp>(</rp><rt>ほしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">艺术家保证这幅画是真实的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">補償</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">补偿；赔偿；赔款</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143130\"><ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>損害<rp>(</rp><rt>そんがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>補償<rp>(</rp><rt>ほしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなければならなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">政府不得不赔偿损失。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">補充</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほじゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">补充；补充物；补充品；更换；补充供应</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179321\"><ruby>空所<rp>(</rp><rt>くうしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>補充<rp>(</rp><rt>ほじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把空位补充起来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">補助</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほじょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">协助；支援；帮助；补助；补贴；津贴；拨款；保护（举重训练中的动作）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207097\">その<ruby>飛行機<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>補助<rp>(</rp><rt>ほじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ロケットを<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>離陸<rp>(</rp><rt>りりく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">飞机用辅助火箭着陆。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">干す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">晾干；晒干；使干燥；沥干；排干；喝干；饮尽；使失去职位；剥夺工作机会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221899\">この<ruby>座布団<rp>(</rp><rt>ざぶとん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>干<rp>(</rp><rt>ほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请把这个座位干净。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">細い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほそい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">细的；纤细的；精细的；（台球行话）运气差的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"102553\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>太<rp>(</rp><rt>ふと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っているくせに<ruby>声<rp>(</rp><rt>こえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>細<rp>(</rp><rt>ほそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的声音很薄,因为他太胖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">舗装</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">铺装；铺设；路面</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207731\">その<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りはアスファルトで<ruby>舗装<rp>(</rp><rt>ほそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这条街道是用阿斯法尔特装饰的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">补充；补足</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">保存</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほぞん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保存；保留；储存；维护；（计算机）保存文件；存盘</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184718\"><ruby>外付<rp>(</rp><rt>そとづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けのハードディスクに<ruby>保存<rp>(</rp><rt>ほぞん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しといて。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把它保存在外接式硬碟。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/798183\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">北極</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ほっきょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">北极；北极地区；北极圈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>"]